  "reviewed_chain": [
    "CCompanyType RTTI selects the parser at +0x598. The ai_will_do atom 0x29df selects trigger interface +0x320 and storage +0x318. The ai_weight atom 0x53ce selects numeric member +0x390.",
    "The wrapper calls eligibility at 0x14164e818 before scoring at 0x14164e836 with the same Country context. The definition supplies expression storage.",
    "The current selection call at 0x14165e5a8 writes the score to [rsp+0x30]. The signed less-or-equal jump at 0x14165e5b3 skips a zero or negative score."
  ],
